<title>USA: Evergreen Media to redeem preferred series.</title>
<headline>Evergreen Media to redeem preferred series.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evergreen Media Corp said on Wednesday that it would redeem all of its outstanding $3.00 covertible exchangeable preferred stock.</p>
<p>The radio broadcasting company will redeem all shares of preferred stock outstanding at the close of business on December 27 at $52.70 each.</p>
<p>The redemption price, calculated pursuant to the preferred stock's certificate of designation, equals 104.2 percent of the $50 liquidation preference of each share, plus accrued and unpaid dividends.</p>
